 {'id':'LIVE-02','severity':'major','category':'product_reporting_defect','status':'open','arms':[a for a in ARMLIST if a!='recovery-treatment'],'requirements':['R-023','R-027','R-032'],'summary':'Generated reports state Unknowns: None while their own snapshots and delivered narratives retain important unknowns; creative also states Untested evidence: None despite named untested experience checks.','evidence':['reporting-checks.json','record-inspection.json'],'reproduction':'verify_reporting.py regenerates seven reports on copies, byte-identically. Six render Unknowns: None. Agents in those same snapshots retain effective_model/effective_effort unknown; data memos explicitly retain missing M09 and unidentified causality, creative final report retains untested screen reader/reduced motion/touch, and promotion retains unobserved transfer.','fix_check':'Make empty typed sections say no entries recorded rather than no unknowns; render directly stored unknown identity/effects and ensure material task unknown/untested facts receive typed evidence during recording. Regenerate these copied examples and show no unqualified denial contradicting their explicit unknowns.','scope_note':'Supplemental final reports correctly disclose the unknowns, so this does not invalidate numerical/game results or allege invented effective identities. It prevents a full reporting pass for the six delivered report sets. Recovery correctly contains an unknown-kind evidence entry and clearly states the open source barrier.'},
